    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n58260" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόβαρος:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνθρωπος</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i>
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόβειρος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>jester</i>, Id.:
				Adj., in pl., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόβειρα:
			γελοῖα</span>, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοβελίσκον:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρύβλιον</span>, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόγκαλος:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κονιορτός</span>, Id. (leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κονίσαλος</span>). <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόγξ</span></b> , onomatop., sound made by the
			voting-pebble as it fell into the urn, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κογχαλίζω</span></b> , of shells, <i>murmur</i>,
		Id.</div>
